      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakashikishabo malu â, bantu banene bakalua kundi, bamba ne, Bena Isalele ne bakuidi ne Bena Lewi kabena baditahulula kudi bena buloba ebu, badi benza malu a bundu a Bena Kanâna ne a Bena Hiti ne a Bena Pelese ne a Bena Yebuse ne a Bena Amona ne a Bena Moaba ne a Bena Ejipitu ne a Bena Amole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua bobo ne bana babo balume bakadiangatshila bana bakashi ba bantu aba bu bakashi babo; nunku bantu ba tshijila bakabuelakana ne bena maloba â; bulelela, bantu banene ne bakokeshi bakadianjila kuenza bubi ebu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanakunvua bualu ebu, nakadihanda bilulu bianyi ne tshikowelu tshianyi, nakadila nsuki yanyi ne muedi wanyi; akashikama hanshi ntua mikemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe bakadisangisha kundi, muntu ne muntu, bakadi bazakala bua mei a Nzambi wa Isalele bualu bua bubi bua bantu aba bakumuka mu buhika; nakashikama hanshi ntua mikemu tô ne ku diba dia kufila mulambu wa ku dilolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakafika diba dia kufila mulambu wa ku dilolo, nakajuka mu kudihuekesha kuanyi ne bilulu bianyi ne tshikowelu tshianyi bihandika; nakatua binu bianyi hanshi, nakolola bianza bianyi kudi Yehowa, Nzambi wanyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nakamba ne,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O Nzambi wanyi, bundu budi bunkuata bikole bua meme kuhandisha mesu anyi kûdi, Nzambi wanyi; bualu bua malu mabi etu akavulangana ha mitu hetu, ne kuhila kuetu kuakamana kufika mu diulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku matuku a bankambua betu tô ne ku lelu tuakutamba kuhila; bua malu mabi etu, tuetu ne bakelenge betu ne bakuidi betu tuakafidibua mu bianza bia bakelenge ba maloba makuabo ku muele wa nvita, ku buhika ne ku kuhaula kua bintu bietu ne ku kufuishibua kua bundu ku mesu, bu mudibiku lelu eu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katataka mu tshituha tshikese Yehowa, Nzambi wetu, wakutulesha luse luandi bua kutushila difuka dikese dia bantu ne bua kutuha mutshi wa tshikuminu mu muaba wandi wa tshijila, bua Nzambi wetu atabashe mesu etu, bua kutusangasha mu buhika buetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua tudi bahika; kadi Nzambi kakutulekela mu buhika buetu, wakutuvuisha ne luse ku mesu kua bakelenge ba Pelasa bua kutusangashabo ne bua kutuashilabo nsubu wa Nzambi wetu, ne bua kulongololabo miaba idi mihaula ne bua kutahabo lumbu mu Yuda ne mu Yelushalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku nyima kua malu â onso, Nzambi wetu, netuambe tshinyi? Bualu bua tuetu tuakubenga mikenji yebe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iwakuelela bantu bebe baprofete ne, Buloba bunudi nuya bua kuhiana budi bunyanguka bua malu mabi a bena buloba ne malu abo a bundu; bakûsha buloba abu tente ne dinyanguka diabo ku mukala umue tô ne kunfudilu kuabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku kanufidi bana benu bakashi kudi bana babo balume; kanuangatshidi bana benu balume bana babo bakashi; kanukebi ditalala diabo anyi diakalengele diabo tô ne tshiendelele; bua nuenu nuikale ne bukole, bua nuenu nudie bintu bimpe bia mu buloba abu, ne bua nuenu nubushile bana benu bu buhianyi buabo bua tshiendelele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku nyima kua makenga onso atuakakenga bua malu mabi etu ne kuhila kuetu kunene, bualu bua wewe Nzambi wetu kuakatamba kutukengesha bu muakadi mibi yetu, ne wakutushila difuka edi dia bantu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "netushihe mikenji yebe kabidi bua kubuelakana ne bantu aba mu malu abo a bundu munyi? Bituenza nunku wewe kuena wikala nʼetu tshiji tô ne hawatubutula buonso buetu, nunku difuka dikese dia bantu kadiena mua kushala anyi kuhanduka, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa, Nzambi wa Isalele, wewe udi muakane; bualu bua wewe wakatahila difuka dihanduka bu mudidi lelu eu; mona, tudi ku mesu kuebe mu kuhila kuetu; kakuena udi mumanye mua kuimana ku mpala kuebe bua bualu ebu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
